44
00:03:26,260 --> 00:03:29,310
Yeah, looks like it. Thank you so much, sir!

45
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,310
Excuse me! Sorry!

46
00:03:31,850 --> 00:03:33,350
Excuse me!

47
00:03:33,350 --> 00:03:35,220
Sorry!

48
00:03:35,890 --> 00:03:37,020
Sorry!

49
00:03:39,270 --> 00:03:42,780
